/F2 10.3 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 320.40000000000043 Tm
(Authentication Sequence) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 306.40000000000043 Tm
(1. User submits credentials to /auth/login.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 290.40000000000043 Tm
(2. Backend validates credentials via authentication manager.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 274.40000000000043 Tm
(3. JwtUtil generates JWT containing role claim and expiry.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 258.40000000000043 Tm
(4. Frontend stores token and user payload in localStorage.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 242.40000000000043 Tm
(5. User is redirected to /admin or /dashboard based on role.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 10.3 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 218.40000000000043 Tm
(Validation Sequence) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 204.40000000000043 Tm
(1. Axios request interceptor attaches Bearer token.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 188.40000000000043 Tm
(2. JwtAuthenticationFilter validates signature and expiration.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 172.40000000000043 Tm
(3. SecurityContext is set with authenticated principal.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
1 0 0 1 46 156.40000000000043 Tm
(4. Request reaches controller under role constraints.) Tj
ET
